<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>Pokémon Theme</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">Pokémon</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">Pokémon: 2.B.A. Master (Music from the TV Series)</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">3mNH9BXFcNElEFbgKqmq1J</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:06.753" end="00:09.483">I wanna be the very best</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:09.483" end="00:13.347">Like no one ever was</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:13.347" end="00:16.137">To catch them is my real test</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:16.137" end="00:20.106">To train them is my cause</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:20.106" end="00:22.899">I will travel across the land</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:22.899" end="00:26.527">Searching far and wide</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:26.527" end="00:29.477">Each pokemon to understand</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:29.477" end="00:32.405">The power that's inside</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:32.405" end="00:34.727">Pokemon! Gotta catch them all!</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:34.727" end="00:36.610">It's you and me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:36.610" end="00:39.211">I know it's my destiny</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:39.211" end="00:40.711">Pokemon!</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:40.198" end="00:42.703">Oh you're my best friend</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:42.703" end="00:45.674">In a world we must defend</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:45.674" end="00:47.899">Pokemon! Gotta catch them all!</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:47.899" end="00:50.219">A heart so true</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:50.219" end="00:53.199">Our courage will pull us through</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:53.199" end="00:56.095">You teach me and I'll teach you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:56.095" end="00:58.298">Pokemon!</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:58.298" end="00:59.798">Gotta catch them all!</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:59.773" end="01:04.712">Gotta catch them all!</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:04.712" end="01:08.056">Yeah!</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:08.056" end="01:10.903">Every challenge along the way</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:10.903" end="01:14.728">With courage I will face</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:14.728" end="01:17.479">I will battle every day</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:17.479" end="01:21.239">To claim my rightful place</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:21.239" end="01:22.739">Come with me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:22.528" end="01:24.313">The time is right</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:24.313" end="01:27.804">There's no better team</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:27.804" end="01:30.564">Arm in arm we'll win the fight</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:30.564" end="01:33.820">It's always been our dream</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:33.820" end="01:35.701">Pokemon! Gotta catch them all!</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:35.701" end="01:37.990">It's you and me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:37.990" end="01:40.386">I know it's my destiny</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:40.386" end="01:41.886">Pokemon!</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:41.498" end="01:44.026">Oh you're my best friend</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:44.026" end="01:46.843">In a world we must defend</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:46.843" end="01:49.048">Pokemon! Gotta catch them all!</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:49.048" end="01:51.097">A heart so true</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:51.097" end="01:54.205">Our courage will pull us through</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:54.205" end="01:57.390">You teach me and I'll teach you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:57.390" end="01:59.617">Pokemon!</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:59.617" end="02:07.617">Gotta catch them all!</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:25.517" end="02:33.517">Yeah!</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:43.796" end="02:47.089">Pokemon! Gotta catch them all!</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:47.089" end="02:48.589">It's you and me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:48.053" end="02:50.496">I know it's my destiny</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:50.496" end="02:51.996">Pokemon!</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:51.094" end="02:53.290">Oh you're my best friend</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:53.290" end="02:55.839">In a world we must defend</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:55.839" end="02:58.534">Pokemon! Gotta catch them all!</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:58.534" end="03:00.637">A heart so true</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:00.637" end="03:03.659">Our courage will pull us through</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:03.659" end="03:08.088">You teach me and I'll teach you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:08.088" end="03:09.588">Pokemon!</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:09.132" end="03:10.839">Gotta catch them all!</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:10.839" end="03:12.696">Gotta catch them all!</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:12.696" end="03:16.696">Pokémon!</p></div></body></tt>